machine.spacemoduleassembler.tooltip.recipe.header=§6Assembling:
machine.spacemoduleassembler.tooltip.recipe.pool=§7· Runs the §bSpace Assembler§7 recipe pool, matching recipes from the available inputs
machine.spacemoduleassembler.tooltip.recipe.parallel=§7· Each recipe runs with §b2,147,483,647§7 (integer limit) parallel, actually limited by available inputs
machine.spacemoduleassembler.tooltip.recipe.cross=§7· Automatically runs up to §b256§7 cross-recipe cycles per work cycle, no GUI configuration needed
machine.spacemoduleassembler.tooltip.recipe.tier=§7· Module tier §b5§7; recipes above module tier §b5§7 are rejected
machine.spacemoduleassembler.tooltip.recipe.project=§7· Needs the §bspace project§7 and §blocation§7 required by the recipe
