machine.nqdafreactor.machinetype=Large Naquadah Annihilation Field Reactor
machine.nqdafreactor.tooltip.desc=§7A large annihilation-field generator driven by liquid nuclear fuel or liquid naquadah fuel.
machine.nqdafreactor.tooltip.flavour=§7Feed the field and let time do the rest.
machine.nqdafreactor.tooltip.operation.header=§6Operation:
machine.nqdafreactor.tooltip.operation.efficiency=§7· Work efficiency rises by §b1%§7 per §b30s§7 of running, up to §b400%§7; higher efficiency extends each fuel's burn time (burn time = recipe duration × efficiency ÷ 100); running also costs §b1,000,000 L/s§7 of Liquid Air, and without it generation drops to zero while the fuel keeps burning
machine.nqdafreactor.tooltip.operation.decay=§7· After stopping, work efficiency decays over time but never drops below §b100%§7; while idle, injecting Molten Spacetime freezes the decay for §b30s§7, with the dose doubling from §b1 L/s§7 up to §b1,073,741,824 L/s§7; the freeze only suppresses idle decay and never the running efficiency gain
machine.nqdafreactor.tooltip.operation.output=§7· Generation = base recipe EU/t × coil tier × coolant efficiency × excited multiplier × parallel ÷ 100; coil tiers I-IV scale output from ×§b1§7 to ×§b4§7; parallel is the lower of available fuel ÷ fuel per batch and the power-panel parallel limit, hard-capped at §b2,147,483,647§7
machine.nqdafreactor.tooltip.operation.wireless=§7· With no Dynamo Hatch it switches to wireless mode automatically and feeds the wireless network directly, carrying values above §b9,223,372,036,854,775,807§7; with a Dynamo Hatch it uses wired output, at most §b1§7 dynamo hatch, and parallel is additionally limited by the long output ceiling
