machine.nqdafreactor.tooltip.coolant.tachyon=§7· §b20 L/s§7 Tachyon-Rich Temporal Fluid: coolant efficiency §b500%§7
machine.nqdafreactor.tooltip.coolant.cryotheum=§7· §b1,000 L/s§7 Cryotheum: coolant efficiency §b275%§7
machine.nqdafreactor.tooltip.coolant.supercoolant=§7· §b1,000 L/s§7 Super Coolant: coolant efficiency §b150%§7
machine.nqdafreactor.tooltip.coolant.ic2=§7· §b1,000 L/s§7 IC2 Coolant: coolant efficiency §b105%§7
