machine.nqdafreactor.tooltip.excited.atomic=§7· §b20 L/s§7 Molten Atomic Separation Catalyst: output and fuel consumption ×§b16
machine.nqdafreactor.tooltip.excited.naquadah=§7· §b20 L/s§7 Molten Naquadah: output and fuel consumption ×§b4
machine.nqdafreactor.tooltip.excited.uranium235=§7· §b180 L/s§7 Molten Uranium-235: output and fuel consumption ×§b3
