machine.dbbfurnace.tooltip.mode.switch=§7· Switch modes with a screwdriver; §cswitching is blocked while running§7
machine.dbbfurnace.tooltip.mode.blast=§7· Mode §b1§7 Brick Blast Furnace: uses the GT primitive blast recipe pool (iron + coal/charcoal → steel)
machine.dbbfurnace.tooltip.mode.metallurgy=§7· Mode §b2§7 Metallurgy: uses this mod's steel brick recipes (iron + circuit §b1§7 → steel, etc.)
