machine.dbbfurnace.tooltip.power.free=§7· No energy is consumed and the structure §caccepts no energy hatch§7; recipe EU is ignored entirely
machine.dbbfurnace.tooltip.power.tier=§7· Recipe voltage tier is not checked: §aany tier§7 runs directly
machine.dbbfurnace.tooltip.power.one_tick=§7· Every recipe finishes in exactly §b1§7 tick, regardless of its own duration
machine.dbbfurnace.tooltip.power.parallel=§7· Parallel limit §b2,147,483,647§7, in practice bounded by input/output bus capacity
machine.dbbfurnace.tooltip.details=§dDetails:§7 no void protection: §cexcess products that do not fit the output busses are destroyed
