machine.mtreactor.name=Nuclear Reactor
machine.mtreactor.machinetype=Nuclear Reactor
machine.mtreactor.tooltip.desc=§7A nuclear reactor: components, heat and explosions, all included
machine.mtreactor.tooltip.flavour=§7You stack the core, you pay the bill
machine.mtreactor.tooltip.structure.header=§6Structure:
machine.mtreactor.tooltip.structure.access=§7· Reactor Access Hatches §e(EV..UIV)§7 hold the components; every §b9x6§7 page is an independent reactor
machine.mtreactor.tooltip.structure.pages=§7· Hatch tier sets the page count: §eEV§7 1 page, §b+1§7 per tier, §eUIV§7 8 pages
machine.mtreactor.tooltip.structure.heat=§7· Needs exactly §b1§7 Reactor Heat Control Hatch §e(EV..UIV)§7; its tier sets the heat ceiling (§b10,000§7 to §b50,000,000§7)
machine.mtreactor.tooltip.structure.tier=§7· That tier also caps the Reactor Access Hatches: a hatch above the heat control hatch's tier is refused
machine.mtreactor.tooltip.core.header=§6Core:
machine.mtreactor.tooltip.core.cycle=§7· One IC2 cycle every §b20§7 ticks: heat first, then generation, accumulated per page
machine.mtreactor.tooltip.core.heat=§7· From §c70%§7 heat nearby entities are irradiated, from §c85%§7 the surroundings can ignite
machine.mtreactor.tooltip.core.meltdown=§7· At §c100%§7 the core does not detonate at once: a §c30 s§7 meltdown countdown starts, and only when it runs out does it §cnuke§7 and destroy the machine
machine.mtreactor.tooltip.core.cooling=§7· The heat control hatch bleeds heat off passively, whether or not the reactor is switched on
machine.mtreactor.tooltip.power.header=§6Power:
machine.mtreactor.tooltip.power.output=§7· Generation = §bcore output × 5 × IC2's §bconfig multiplier * 2§7, emitted through dynamo hatches
machine.mtreactor.tooltip.details=§dDetails:§7 slots can lock a component type and auto output/restock at their §bthreshold§7 (needs an input and an output bus)
machine.mtreactor.tooltip.details.fluidmode=§7· Screwdriver on the controller toggles the fluid (wet) mode; it needs one Reactor Coolant Input Hatch and one Reactor Hot Coolant Output Hatch
machine.mtreactor.tooltip.details.hint=§7· Shift+Right click locks a type, Alt+Shift+Right click unlocks all, middle click opens the settings
